LUMA SUMMARY:
Duckmail 2.0 specification begins. Cozmo archives the design as a standalone text/title artifact and treats it as a canonical behavioral contract. The key shift is from Fan-Out relay mechanics toward a courier Duck with address/mailbox/pocket semantics.
